# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore: keeps host build trees, VCS metadata, and
# caches out of the build context uploaded to the daemon. Only COPY'd public
# paths (ocudu/, ocudu-dapp-sdk/, ocudu-docker/scripts/) enter image layers.
**/build/
**/build-*/
**/.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/*.sw[op]
*.tar.gz
*.pdf
*.patch
